# `rtok agents whoami` (T283): no `RTOK_AGENT_ID` set → exit 1. The success/`--json`
# path is not deterministic here (a fresh UUID and timestamps per run) and is covered
# by an integration test instead.

```console
$ HOME=target/tmp/t283-whoami RTOK_HOME=target/tmp/t283-whoami rtok agents whoami
? 1
Error: not inside an agent session

```
